{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/1d5985555135a7c34052097d2754c9e2.avif?t=1770334737\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valkyrie Saga is an indie, retro platformer styled after PSX classics, giving you a chance to embark on an epic odyssey! Play as Roll the Valkyrie, a divine warrior tasked by the gods with one mission: Stopping a floating island from crashing into the earth. Ascend the ancient skyborne land, explore ancient ruins, unlock their secrets - and stop the cataclysm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/bbea6452db95b46b482707f6e519a6ee.poster.avif?t=1770334737\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/bbea6452db95b46b482707f6e519a6ee.webm?t=1770334737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/bbea6452db95b46b482707f6e519a6ee.mp4?t=1770334737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/40f2ec562c32258dc68a8ef19882ce6e.avif?t=1770334737\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valkyrie Saga captures the original PSX with era-authentic visuals, a deeply immersive soundtrack, and gameplay that recreates the magic that defined a generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/20eacba0d91dbe1678547ce78831e054.poster.avif?t=1770334737\" width=1170 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/20eacba0d91dbe1678547ce78831e054.webm?t=1770334737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/20eacba0d91dbe1678547ce78831e054.mp4?t=1770334737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/32f76e9bd587df107f0247970ca4507d.avif?t=1770334737\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the divine warrior, you'll have to master both the art of soaring across the skies across the plummeting island, and the way of the spear, confronting otherworldly foes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/306bfede265b66d70de523cd53d2df22.poster.avif?t=1770334737\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/306bfede265b66d70de523cd53d2df22.webm?t=1770334737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/306bfede265b66d70de523cd53d2df22.mp4?t=1770334737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663150/extras/a29a3edba8a571e5a3251d5660bd1e6d.avif?t=1770334737\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden among the ruins, cryptic scribblings, and odd twists of the world is a complex story to piece together, detailing what happened to the civilization that once occupied the island. Can you find out the truth before it is too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Broken World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/5ed3556a31cf88868a0cd142c56930f79279bbba.jpg"},{"name":"Crystal Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/cba4f6b3974b7047f75054f86d8380aa8eebc6c5.jpg"},{"name":"Valkyrie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/146d4e98077fd7d2e45a273677cdb0653dda1fb5.jpg"},{"name":"Power Glider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/d4cd56428eef6dcf5d41eca7fa367abb2ee18f97.jpg"},{"name":"Crystal Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/87bdfc77eed4935a50d42f1a1962900d3ea3a273.jpg"},{"name":"Beefy Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/2db0821e1b6eef91d2720a8fd5ebe85f88e0f2c4.jpg"},{"name":"Reflection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/bc4b3fe838805b84d2806706748e970998c6c1b1.jpg"},{"name":"The Path of the Goddess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/bb42aafbf7e1ba2f83872fea1ba67ea5e7fe4e82.jpg"},{"name":"Away from the Goddess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/47a4a89e4052b461aebb4ac37b980be5d83d73cd.jpg"},{"name":"Ruined City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2663150/b4509be166533878a31a82bfdb1c62541476628a.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamst